msgstr "``flowing.plugins.comm`` — communication extension subpackage."

#: flowing.plugins.comm:3 of
msgid ""
"本包承载进程内通信扩展的全部公开符号：:class:`CommPlugin` （阶段一 插件）、:func:`use_comm` "
"（阶段二启用）、:class:`Communication` （通信 总线）、:class:`CommHandle` "
"（端点句柄）、:class:`SignalEnvelope` / :class:`EventEnvelope` （两种信封模型）以及 "
"provide 注入键 :data:`communication_key`；对外 API 经本 ``__init__`` 统一再导出。"
msgstr ""
"This package hosts all public symbols of the in-process communication extension: :class:`CommPlugin` (phase-one plugin), :func:`use_comm` "
"(phase-two enablement), :class:`Communication` (the communication bus), :class:`CommHandle` "
"(endpoint handle), :class:`SignalEnvelope` / :class:`EventEnvelope` (the two envelope models), and "
"the provide injection key :data:`communication_key`; the public API is re-exported through this ``__init__``."

