#: flowing.plugins.comm.comm.CommPlugin:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(CommPlugin())`` 时框架调用 ``install(runtime)``，创建 全局 "
"``Communication`` 实例并以 ``communication_key`` provide 到 Runtime provide "
"链根。此后任何 Agent 可经 ``use_comm(self)`` 启用 实例级通信能力。框架核心发布时不预装本插件——未启用的通信扩展 "
"「从没存在过」。"
msgstr ""
"When ``runtime.install(CommPlugin())`` runs, the framework calls ``install(runtime)``, creating the global "
"``Communication`` instance and providing it under ``communication_key`` at the root of the Runtime provide "
"chain. From then on, any Agent can enable instance-level communication via ``use_comm(self)``. The framework core does not ship with this plugin preinstalled — a communication extension that was never enabled "
"\"never existed\"."

