#: flowing.plugins.comm.comm.CommPlugin:13 of
msgid ""
"``install()`` 只做 provide 注册（插件约定：``install`` 只注册， 约定定义见 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins`；本插件无工具、无配置命名 空间、无钩子声明）。"
msgstr ""
"``install()`` only performs the provide registration (plugin contract: ``install`` only registers; the contract is defined in "
":mod:`flowing.plugins`; this plugin has no tools, no config namespace, and no hook declarations)."

#: flowing.plugins.comm.comm.CommPlugin:16 of
msgid ""
"重复安装同名插件（再次 ``runtime.install(CommPlugin())``）→ ``ValueError`` （一个 "
"Runtime 同时只装一个同名插件，见 :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`）。"
msgstr ""
"Installing a plugin with the same name twice (calling ``runtime.install(CommPlugin())`` again) → ``ValueError`` (a "
"Runtime holds at most one plugin of a given name at a time; see :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`)."

#: flowing.plugins.comm.comm.CommPlugin:19 of
msgid ""
"生命周期：``runtime.shutdown()`` 插件收尾阶段调用总线 ``_close()`` 清空端点表与订阅表（挂起请求的取消归各句柄"
" ``destroy()``，总线不兜底）。"
msgstr ""
"Lifecycle: during the plugin finalization phase of ``runtime.shutdown()``, the bus ``_close()`` is called to clear the endpoint table and subscription table (cancellation of pending requests is left to each handle's"
" ``destroy()``; the bus does not backstop it)."

