#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.comm.rst:21
msgid "flowing.plugins.comm.models module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.comm.models module"

#: flowing.plugins.comm.models:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.comm.models`` —— 通信扩展的数据对象。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.comm.models`` — data objects of the communication extension."

#: flowing.plugins.comm.models:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义通信扩展的两种信封模型：:class:`SignalEnvelope` （点对点 信号通道的载体）与 "
":class:`EventEnvelope` （发布-订阅事件通道的载体）。 信封由总线在发送 / 发布路径上构造并自动填充元信息（见各字段 "
"docstring），是 ``on_signal`` / ``on_event`` 钩子 handler 的 value "
"类型，也是端点接收回调的唯一参数。信封只存在于通信通道，不是 ``Message``——不进消息级树、不落盘、不进 LLM 上下文。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines the two envelope models of the communication extension: :class:`SignalEnvelope` (carrier of the point-to-point signal channel) and "
":class:`EventEnvelope` (carrier of the publish-subscribe event channel). Envelopes are constructed by the bus on the send / publish paths with metadata auto-filled (see each field's "
"docstring); they are the value type of ``on_signal`` / ``on_event`` hook handlers and the sole parameter of endpoint receive callbacks. Envelopes exist only in the communication channel and are not ``Message``s — they do not enter the message-level tree, are not persisted, and do not enter the LLM context."

#: flowing.plugins.comm.models:10 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` （扩展的启用方式与整体契约）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.comm.comm` （总线与句柄）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` (how to enable the extension and its overall contract), "
